---

<Layout {...frontmatter}>
  <Hero
    image="/Rositas-menu.webp"
    title="Best Southwest Mexican Breakfast"
    subtitle="in Westminster"
    description="Famous breakfast burritos, authentic green chile, and Southwest Mexican breakfast dishes made fresh daily"
    buttonText="View Menu"
    buttonLink="/menu"
  />
  <div class="pt-16">
    <FeaturedCards cards={cards} />
  </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 pb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-4">Best Southwest Mexican Breakfast in Westminster</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-center mb-6">
            At Rosita's, we're passionate about serving the best Southwest Mexican breakfast in Westminster.  We use fresh, high-quality ingredients and traditional recipes to create the breakfast satisfaction you're looking for.  Our breakfast burritos are a local favorite, made with our famous green chile smothered in our signature sauce. And if you'd like some pancakes and bacon, we have you covered there too!
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-center mb-6">
            Whether you're craving a classic breakfast, a modern brunch twist, or an innovative spin on morning favorites, Rosita's is your premier destination for extraordinary breakfast and brunch experiences in Westminster.
        </p>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-2">Our Breakfast Burrito Specialties</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-center">
            <li><strong>Classic Breakfast Burrito:</strong> Scrambled eggs, potatoes, cheese, and your choice of bacon, sausage, or chorizo.</li>
            <li><strong>Green Chile Smothered Burrito:</strong>  Our classic breakfast burrito, smothered in our award-winning green chile.</li>
            <li><strong>Super Breakfast Burrito:</strong> Breakfast burrito smothered in our green chile, topped with lettuce, cheese and tomatoes.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

  <!-- New container added at the bottom of the page -->
  <div style="width: 100vw; background: url('/texture-transparent.webp') repeat, orange; padding-left: 2rem; padding-right: 2rem; padding-top: 5rem; padding-bottom: 7rem;">
    <h2 style="text-align: center; color: white; font-size: xx-large;">
     FOOD RECIPES PASSED DOWN SINCE 1963
    </h2>
    <p style="text-align: center; color: white; font-size: x-large;">
      Rosita's Mexican Restaurant has a rich history dating back to 1963, when it was founded by Paul Ortega in a small space on West Colfax. Known affectionately as little Rosita's, the restaurant quickly gained a following thanks to Paul's commitment to perfecting traditional recipes passed down from his family...
    </p>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 1rem;">
      <a href="/our-story" class="inline-block bg-white text-grey text-center py-4 px-8 rounded-full text-lg font-semibold hover:bg-grey hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 w-full md:w-auto">
        Our Story
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <StickyCtaBanner />
  <ClosureModal />
</Layout>
